{
 "id": "293-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "It's important that we maintain consistency across our codebases, and one of the things I like to emphasize is a specific naming convention for function and method names.",
  "I want you to always end function argument names with '_j' and method names with '_p'.",
  "This helps us quickly identify arguments and methods in our code and improves readability.",
  "It's a small detail, but it makes a big difference, especially in a large codebase like ours.",
  "No, that's the main one for now.",
  "Just remember that consistency is crucial, and if you have any questions or need clarification on anything, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "It's an important topic, and we need to ensure we're doing our part to create a more equitable workplace.",
  "Now, one of the things we can do is ensure that our hiring processes are bias-free.",
  "We should also encourage open discussions about sensitive topics and provide platforms for minority groups to be heard.",
  "We'll discuss the progress and any challenges you face in our next meeting.",
  "It's essential that we encourage creativity and a willingness to experiment.",
  "No matter how junior or senior, everyone has a voice.",
  "This means actively listening to one another and providing constructive feedback.",
  "We need to embrace a culture of trying new things, even if it means failing sometimes.",
  "So, when you're working on a project, I want you to feel empowered to suggest and trial new approaches.",
  "That's the spirit.",
  "Keep yourself updated with the latest developments in the Python world and don't be afraid to suggest adopting new technologies.",
  "Of course, we'll need to balance this with the stability and reliability of our existing systems, but we can assess that as we go."
 ],
 "admitted": 18,
 "relations_applied": 0,
 "overflow": 216,
 "update_calls": 234,
 "rows": [
  {
   "id": "4:103",
   "text": "It's important that we maintain consistency across our codebases, and one of the things I like to emphasize is a specific naming convention for function and method names.",
   "key": "new:4:103",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 4,
   "span_start": 103
  },
  {
   "id": "5:8",
   "text": "I want you to always end function argument names with '_j' and method names with '_p'.",
   "key": "new:5:8",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 8
  },
  {
   "id": "5:95",
   "text": "This helps us quickly identify arguments and methods in our code and improves readability.",
   "key": "new:5:95",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 95
  },
  {
   "id": "5:186",
   "text": "It's a small detail, but it makes a big difference, especially in a large codebase like ours.",
   "key": "new:5:186",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 186
  },
  {
   "id": "6:0",
   "text": "No, that's the main one for now.",
   "key": "new:6:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 6,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "6:33",
   "text": "Just remember that consistency is crucial, and if you have any questions or need clarification on anything, don't hesitate to reach out.",
   "key": "new:6:33",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 6,
   "span_start": 33
  },
  {
   "id": "9:62",
   "text": "It's an important topic, and we need to ensure we're doing our part to create a more equitable workplace.",
   "key": "new:9:62",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 9,
   "span_start": 62
  },
  {
   "id": "10:96",
   "text": "Now, one of the things we can do is ensure that our hiring processes are bias-free.",
   "key": "new:10:96",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 96
  },
  {
   "id": "10:180",
   "text": "We should also encourage open discussions about sensitive topics and provide platforms for minority groups to be heard.",
   "key": "new:10:180",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 180
  },
  {
   "id": "12:124",
   "text": "We'll discuss the progress and any challenges you face in our next meeting.",
   "key": "new:12:124",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 12,
   "span_start": 124
  },
  {
   "id": "14:103",
   "text": "It's essential that we encourage creativity and a willingness to experiment.",
   "key": "new:14:103",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 14,
   "span_start": 103
  },
  {
   "id": "15:130",
   "text": "No matter how junior or senior, everyone has a voice.",
   "key": "new:15:130",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 15,
   "span_start": 130
  },
  {
   "id": "15:184",
   "text": "This means actively listening to one another and providing constructive feedback.",
   "key": "new:15:184",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 15,
   "span_start": 184
  },
  {
   "id": "16:47",
   "text": "We need to embrace a culture of trying new things, even if it means failing sometimes.",
   "key": "new:16:47",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 16,
   "span_start": 47
  },
  {
   "id": "17:0",
   "text": "So, when you're working on a project, I want you to feel empowered to suggest and trial new approaches.",
   "key": "new:17:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 17,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "18:0",
   "text": "That's the spirit.",
   "key": "new:18:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 18,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "18:19",
   "text": "Keep yourself updated with the latest developments in the Python world and don't be afraid to suggest adopting new technologies.",
   "key": "new:18:19",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 18,
   "span_start": 19
  },
  {
